  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-and-the-big-red-truck-v6-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "b52eabcd3694b6b24241071e812c90450ae1832cc406c15b1fd965de27d5db67",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "05a7564f84aa940bd882438054681fba38449e67680ffee8e86864f0387cca31",
      "text": "悟空和\n大红消防车",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3e8dfd37173c6662c182a3503bd869b31eda1d4ad5a65117307ad439f2b0d36c",
      "text": "一辆大红消防车开过来。\n“哇，轮子好大呀！”\n悟空高兴得尾巴都翘起来了。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8e5806701778d42ae3edeadb677e9ae3ab7d649a8a5c8159569ab2552da57d4a",
      "text": "到了消防站，本叔叔招招手。\n“来，带你们看看！”\n悟空的问题可多啦。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "78356da31c09d874fb17f356c2b307d9cfb61cda874261d0a02ed03b4d0c29ac",
      "text": "“为什么穿大靴子？”\n“大靴子能保护我的脚。”\n悟空看看自己的鞋：\n“我的只会吱吱响！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4f685c042241776c32f185d322e7f03b6070aa1584e84db0d18cfda8194b948a",
      "text": "本叔叔给他一顶玩具头盔。\n帽子一滑，遮住了眉毛。\n“戴成这样，还看得见吗？”\n“那可不行！”本叔叔笑了。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e17815813014af1e9a6e292c1b90b8e16cb4e6a93c172b64cd2ade7a0ff2ddce",
      "text": "本叔叔拿出一个特别的面罩。\n“戴上它，就能呼吸到\n干净的空气。”\n他的声音听起来不一样了！",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4c5224b900ef027a0b0e8b396461f9bd255dfd70da31f6e09f1911d664d3df4e",
      "text": "“还是我呀！”本叔叔说。\n悟空也挥挥手：\n“咦，本叔叔！\n你的声音变啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8209941fdaa4606898616d8ca0d495b03aa3ccc75ad45db0f8e01ca13db8a2d3",
      "text": "“那是一根大面条吗？”\n“是水带！”本叔叔说，\n“水就从这里流过去。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "add1dabfcf4fb810ea8e3bdf234195c27c67975e6e81f0885871b3f2f841ca4e",
      "text": "本叔叔握住水带。\n哗——水喷了出来。\n啪嗒，一滴水\n落在悟空的鼻尖上。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "122bbe10647ee0109245e7259d3af05efad62875d61c58cde516b7c13493339e",
      "text": "“那梯子呢？”\n“它帮我们爬到高处。”\n悟空站在下面，\n尾巴往上伸。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ac5439b4aba401efcf5cf313e5bde4f56056ac9603445d13a9750483d220831e",
      "text": "接着，本叔叔拿出报警器。\n“嘀！嘀！嘀！”\n“这是警报声，在提醒大家。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a2eecafbd821d3edfbc8a780f131c660ff5e3f3361a37bde4ef6bdabee50c657",
      "text": "“听到警报，就到外面去。”\n他们练习怎么走出去。\n“到了外面，就在那里等着，\n别再往里跑。”本叔叔说。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c383e91f08f16f0d25cdd0b3293168971c1aa72d39819138ca0145e2711454b5",
      "text": "他们约好在一棵树下集合。\n“数数有几个鼻子！”悟空说。\n八戒把自己的鼻子数了两遍。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1b30cd72453a0e7f1866533264b89104294e525cb0f56427fb0a2959a0a8f4b4",
      "text": "悟空向本叔叔道谢。\n“消防车真大！\n叔叔又能干，又热心！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "853ce24c46b34953fff00d8a11e11a8605f4f0b0d7bd6bea0689293430eead35",
      "text": "回到家，玩具车响起来：\n呜哇……呜哇……\n声音小了，\n又小了……嘘。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c18d997fa0b5bfe1eaba1617bd475ce288afc1afb7fede873a75b7f6c0f386c0",
      "text": "他给玩具车盖好被子。\n“晚安，小帮手们。”\n房间安静下来了，\n悟空也安静下来了。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5fe2412537ab0ab9a468f8fb7e11a30b221231ff6b956d3c19f2625a27017f1",
